				<r3d:description language="eng">With QED, the Max Weber Foundation (MWS) is providing its own portal for the publication of digital sources and editions. The MWS is thus responding to the need within the Foundation to offer a stable, sustainable and user-friendly solution for the growing number of editorially orientated projects. The content, methodological and conceptual framework provided by the projects is just as multifaceted as the research at the Foundation’s institutes themselves: international, cross-epochal and interdisciplinary.</r3d:description>
